WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.628
How to read any chart in a case, in five steps.

2
00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:07.170
One. Read the title, so you know what the chart is about.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:12.457
Two. Check the axes and the units. Millions or thousands? Dollars or percent?

4
00:00:12.477 --> 00:00:15.078
Three. Read the legend and any footnote.

5
00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:25.094
Four. Find the insight, not a description. Stores doubled, from 75 to 150, while online fell from 40 to 36.

6
00:00:25.114 --> 00:00:28.843
Five. Say what it means for the client, and where you would look next.

7
00:00:28.993 --> 00:00:36.104
So: stores drove all the growth; online is shrinking. I would look at why online customers are leaving.
